  "details": "As it is right now it is unusual to see group instances and even among big groups they are often quite barren, which I believe is because you have to specifically check for them.\n\nSo I believe the sidebar/menu showing worlds your friends are in should also at the very least tell you how many active group instances are available to you.\n\nClicking that would then show a screen with each group instance in more detail.\n\nI feel like making people more aware of active group instances will mean more people join them.",
